# =============================================================================
# Arcane -- root .gitignore
# Covers: C++23/MSVC, premake5, Visual Studio, vcpkg, Rust (ArcaneHub)
# =============================================================================

# -- Build output --------------------------------------------------------------
# The engine's compiled output: Binaries/<cfg>-<sys>-<arch>-md|mono/ and
# Intermediate/Build/ (Intermediate/ is ignored below). Vendored ThirdParty
# libraries still build into their own bin/ + bin-int/ (and a pre-rename
# checkout keeps its old root bin/ + bin-int/).
/Binaries/
bin/
# ...but not a Rust crate's src/bin/ (the arcrelease CLI)
!ArcaneHub/crates/arcane_release/src/bin/
bin-int/

# -- Visual Studio generated files ---------------------------------------------
# Generated by premake5 -- regenerate with GenerateProjects.bat.
*.sln
*.slnx
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
.vs/

# -- MSVC build artifacts ------------------------------------------------------
*.obj
*.o
*.pch
*.gch
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.exp
*.lib
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.aps

# -- Logs and VS diagnostics ---------------------------------------------------
*.log
ErrorList.txt
errorlist.txt

# -- ImGui layout cache --------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime-generated; editor layouts live under %LOCALAPPDATA%\Arcane\editor\.
*.ini

# -- Compiled shader artifacts (DXIL + SPIR-V) ---------------------------------
# Sources are in data/shaders/; artifacts are generated at build time.
data/shaders/generated/

# -- ReferenceProject ----------------------------------------------------------
# Builds like an external game (its own premake workspace over the SDK):
# generated IDE files + build output are derived.
ReferenceProject/ReferenceProject.slnx
ReferenceProject/*.vcxproj*
# The non-MSBuild generator actions arcbuild drives (multibackend hardening):
# `arcbuild generate --action gmake|ninja|xcode4 --project ReferenceProject`
# drops these beside the .slnx above -- derived output, same as the .slnx/
# .vcxproj rules, and the same shapes the arcbuild-fixture block below
# ignores. Scoped to ReferenceProject/ (and the fixture). The ENGINE tree's
# own gmake/ninja output is covered at the bottom of this file: since the
# Linux port (2026-10-05) a Linux generation of the engine workspace is a
# supported in-place build, exactly like the .vcxproj files above.
ReferenceProject/Makefile
ReferenceProject/*.make
ReferenceProject/build.ninja
ReferenceProject/*.ninja
ReferenceProject/*.xcodeproj/
ReferenceProject/*.xcworkspace/
ReferenceProject/Binaries/
ReferenceProject/Intermediate/
# `arcbuild package` output (engine modularization s3.3).
ReferenceProject/Packages/
# The engine's monolithic layout's generated workspace + project files, and the
# vendor wrappers' monolithic project files (premake5.lua ARC_MONOLITHIC_PROJECTS).
/Intermediate/
/ThirdParty/*/ide-mono/
# Task 12a: a bless run points --project at this SOURCE tree, so a harvest
# during a bless (MaterialPreviewHarvester's thumbnailDir) would otherwise
# drop Saved/Thumbnails/<guid>.png here.
ReferenceProject/Saved/

# -- Stray MSBuild log dirs (txt/log pairs msbuild drops beside projects) ------
Source/*/Arcane*/Arcane*/
Source/Programs/arc*/arc*/
Tests/ArcaneTests/ArcaneTests/

# -- arcbuild-fixture generated backend artifacts (multibackend hardening) ----
# Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/ is a committed, input-only Premake
# project (Fixture.arcproj, premake5.lua, Source/) -- real generation always
# happens against a unique temp copy (the [build-generator] test, scripts/
# verify-arcbuild-backends.ps1, verify-arcbuild-posix.sh), never here. These
# rules only guard against an accidental in-place `premake5 <action>` run
# leaving stray gmake/ninja/xcode4 output half-tracked; they never match the
# three committed input files above.
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/Makefile
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/*.make
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/build.ninja
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/*.ninja
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/*.xcodeproj/
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/*.xcworkspace/
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/Binaries/
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/Intermediate/
Tests/ArcaneTests/data/arcbuild-fixture/obj/

# -- vcpkg in-tree clones ------------------------------------------------------
# vcpkg lives outside the repo at $VCPKG_ROOT; the overlay triplet
# (vcpkg-triplets/) is tracked.
vcpkg/
vcpkg_installed/

# -- Reference-only local dumps -- deliberately untracked ----------------------
.example/
.screenshots/
data/images/icons/

# -- Agent/tool caches ---------------------------------------------------------
# .claude/ is local agent state EXCEPT the project skills and the project settings
# (settings.json enables the superpowers workflow plugin), which are checked in.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json
.superpowers/
graphify-out/
ide-md/

# -- OS metadata ---------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.stackdump

# -- Linux DXC (scripts/fetch-dxc-linux.sh) -----------------------------------
# The Linux shader compiler release, fetched rather than vendored.
ThirdParty/tools/dxc-linux/
# The Linux/macOS premake5 (scripts/fetch-premake.sh), beside the vendored .exe.
ThirdParty/premake5/premake5

# -- macOS Vulkan SDK + DXC (scripts/fetch-vulkan-sdk-macos.sh) --------------
# MoltenVK, the loader, the validation layer and DXC, installed per machine;
# dxc-macos/ is the wrapper + symlinks into it.
ThirdParty/tools/vulkan-sdk-macos/
ThirdParty/tools/dxc-macos/

# -- Test reports (scripts/run-tests.sh / run-tests.ps1) ---------------------
/test-results/
/logs/

# -- Engine gmake/ninja outputs (Linux port, 2026-10-05) ----------------------
# `premake5 gmake` writes the root Makefile plus one <Project>.make beside each
# project's sources (premake's project location IS the source dir, as with the
# .vcxproj files) -- derived output, regenerated per machine.
/Makefile
/build.ninja
/Source/*/*/Makefile
/Tests/*/Makefile
/Tests/Fixtures/*/Makefile
/ThirdParty/*/ide-md/Makefile
*.make
*.ninja
.ninja_log
.ninja_deps
